HV-06: held-by → ST-01 to ST-05; party-to → VT-01, VT-02, VT-04; operationalized-by → M-02, M-04, M-05, M-06, M-08, M-21, M-22, M-23; explained-by → HFC-01 to HFC-05, HFC-07, HFC-15, HFC-16.

HV-07: held-by → ST-01, ST-03, ST-05; party-to → VT-05; operationalized-by → M-04; explained-by → HFC-04, HFC-15.

